# PR Review Comments Format

When the user asks for **PR comments**, **review comments to paste**, or
**must/should/suggestion/nit** output for a PR/task review:

1. Read and follow `.agents/skills/pr-review-comments/SKILL.md` (kit symlink).
2. Emit **English** paste-ready blocks (unless user asks for Vietnamese).
3. Each finding: emoji + number + title → `📍 File` → label line → optional code →
   `**Repro:**` → `**Suggestion:**` → optional `Priority:`.
4. Labels: `must` 🔴 · `should` 🟠 · `suggestion` 🟡 · `nit` 🔵.
5. End with one-line **PR verdict** (BLOCKED / READY).

This does **not** replace Stage-8 `code-review` Full report when `/review-staged`
needs Intent & Coverage / boundary sweep — convert findings into this format when
the deliverable is GitHub comments.
